{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the shot \u2014 or be taken out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>1v1 Top Down online sniper duel</strong> where matches are fought in <strong>best-of-3 rounds</strong>. Win three rounds to claim victory. Every bullet, every breath, and every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total 8 Playable Maps but Demo includes only one map.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Duels</strong> \u2013 Face off in tense, head-to-head sniper battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Challenge friends or test your aim against players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Shot Kills</strong> \u2013 No health bars. No second chances. Land the perfect shot or lose it all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Arenas</strong> \u2013 Minimalist maps built for strategy, positioning, and quick thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish Minimalism</strong> \u2013 Clean, sharp design that keeps the focus on you, your rifle, and your rival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to pick up. Hard to master.</strong> <br>This is pure sniper combat \u2014 stripped down, focused, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to prove you\u2019ve got the <strong>coldest sight</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040260?t=1758300231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040260?t=1758300231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040260/5e21fb3bfdae433adb690b4193e07e3e2c8b65a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758300231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040260/5e21fb3bfdae433adb690b4193e07e3e2c8b65a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758300231","categories":[{